                    <p>Bioxia Cell Culture System/CBOX</p>


                </div>


                <div class="normalcontent">
                    <p>Systems include a cell culture chamber connected to a gas controller user to control O<sub>2</sub> and CO<sub>2</sub> levels. Cost effective and ideal for those starting  small scale hypoxia experiments. </p>
                    <h2>Features of Bioxia Cell Chamber (CBOX):</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Allows users to simulate Hypoxia/Physoxia/Hyperoxia conditions. </li>
                        <li>The O<sub>2</sub> and CO<sub>2</sub> set points can be reached quickly.</li>
                        <li>Simple touchscreen on the Gas controller allows user to change O<sub>2</sub> and CO<sub>2</sub> levels easily</li>
                        <li>Automatic hypoxia cycling programme included.</li>
                        <li>The Cell Culture Chamber can be placed in an incubator while the Gas Controller remains outside the incubator. They are connected via the gas tubes and the communications cable.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>Technical Specification Of Cell Culture Chamber & Gas Controller:</h2>

                    <ul>
                        <li>Chamber Size, choice of large or small:</li>
                        <li>Small (W x H x D in mm): 340 x 300 x 160 </li>
                        <li>Large (W x H x D in mm): 360 x 300 x 230</li>
                        <li>The material of whole shell and shelf is acrylic</li>
                        <li>The chamber is connected to a gas controller via a communications cable and gas tubes. </li>
                        <li>The O<sub>2</sub> and CO<sub>2</sub> sensors are installed in the Gas controller.</li>
                        <li>A dish of distilled water can be installed in the culture chamber to increase humidity</li>
                        <li>Voltage: 230 AC</li>
                        <li>Weight: 10Kg</li>
                        <li>Certification: CE</li>
                    </ul>
                    <h2>Gas Controller: </h2>

                    <ul>
                        <li>O2 Control: From 0.0 to 25.0% in 0.1% increments</li>
                        <li>CO2 control: From 0.0 to 20.0% in 0.1% increments</li>
                        <li>Can pre-programme O<sub>2</sub> and CO<sub>2</sub> cycles in advance</li>
                       
                    </ul>



